message: "If you use simplydata, please cite it as below."
title: "simplydata: simple words for data science in Python"
abstract: >-
  simplydata gives simple, readable English words over pandas, Polars, NumPy,
  SciPy, matplotlib and seaborn for tables, charts, numbers and statistics.
  Every printed statistical result is tested against R.
